<title>USA: Cali Realty offering over-allotment set.</title>
<headline>Cali Realty offering over-allotment set.</headline>
<dateline>CRANFORD, N.J. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cali Realty Corp said the underwriters of its 15.25-million share secondary offering exercised the option to issue another 2,287,500 shares to cover over-allotment.</p>
<p>The price of all shares issued in the offering, including the over-allotment shares, was 26-5/8.</p>
